---
// Frequently Asked Questions Accordion Section
---

<section id="faq" class="bg-[rgba(229,236,246,0.54)] py-20" data-ps="src/components/home/FAQ.astro:wpdra4">
  <div class="max-w-[1000px] mx-auto px-6" data-ps="src/components/home/FAQ.astro:ybu4z7">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="text-center mb-12" data-ps="src/components/home/FAQ.astro:ybu4z6">
      <h2 class="font-bold leading-[1.3] font-serif mb-3 text-[rgb(2,6,4)] text-[36px]" data-ps="src/components/home/FAQ.astro:dzhsdv">
        Frequently Asked Questions
      </h2>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground text-[18px]" data-ps="src/components/home/FAQ.astro:v2sduf">
        Find answers to what matters most about your case and how we work.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Accordion List -->
    <div class="space-y-4" data-ps="src/components/home/FAQ.astro:ybu4z5">
      <!-- Item 1 -->
      <details class="group bg-white p-6 rounded-[8px] shadow-sm border border-black/5 [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer font-bold text-[18px] text-foreground font-serif">
          <h3 data-ps="src/components/home/FAQ.astro:7art2g">How does contingency work?</h3>
          <span class="text-primary text-2xl transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 font-sans font-light" data-ps="src/components/home/FAQ.astro:o4fbo7">+</span>
        </summary>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[15px] text-foreground leading-[1.6]" data-ps="src/components/home/FAQ.astro:v2sdug">
          You pay nothing upfront and nothing if we lose. We only collect a fee from the settlement or judgment we win for you. This means our interests are aligned with yours from day one.
        </p>
      </details>

      <!-- Item 2 -->
      <details class="group bg-white p-6 rounded-[8px] shadow-sm border border-black/5 [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer font-bold text-[18px] text-foreground font-serif">
          <h3 data-ps="src/components/home/FAQ.astro:7art2f">What cases do you take?</h3>
          <span class="text-primary text-2xl transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 font-sans font-light" data-ps="src/components/home/FAQ.astro:o4fbo8">+</span>
        </summary>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[15px] text-foreground leading-[1.6]" data-ps="src/components/home/FAQ.astro:v2sduh">
          We handle personal injury and wrongful death cases across Michigan. If you've been harmed by someone else's negligence, we want to hear from you. We take on cases others won't.
        </p>
      </details>

      <!-- Item 3 -->
      <details class="group bg-white p-6 rounded-[8px] shadow-sm border border-black/5 [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer font-bold text-[18px] text-foreground font-serif">
          <h3 data-ps="src/components/home/FAQ.astro:dig58v">How long does this take?</h3>
          <span class="text-primary text-2xl transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 font-sans font-light" data-ps="src/components/home/FAQ.astro:o4fbo9">+</span>
        </summary>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[15px] text-foreground leading-[1.6]" data-ps="src/components/home/FAQ.astro:v2sdui">
          Every case is different. Some settle quickly, others require trial. We'll be honest about the timeline and keep you informed every step of the way.
        </p>
      </details>

      <!-- Item 4 -->
      <details class="group bg-white p-6 rounded-[8px] shadow-sm border border-black/5 [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer font-bold text-[18px] text-foreground font-serif">
          <h3 data-ps="src/components/home/FAQ.astro:dig58w">Will my case go to trial?</h3>
          <span class="text-primary text-2xl transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 font-sans font-light" data-ps="src/components/home/FAQ.astro:o4fboa">+</span>
        </summary>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[15px] text-foreground leading-[1.6]" data-ps="src/components/home/FAQ.astro:v2sduj">
          We're prepared to go to trial if needed to get you the compensation you deserve. Many cases settle, but we never back down from a fight.
        </p>
      </details>

      <!-- Item 5 -->
      <details class="group bg-white p-6 rounded-[8px] shadow-sm border border-black/5 [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer font-bold text-[18px] text-foreground font-serif">
          <h3 data-ps="src/components/home/FAQ.astro:dig58x">What should I do now?</h3>
          <span class="text-primary text-2xl transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 font-sans font-light" data-ps="src/components/home/FAQ.astro:o4fbow">+</span>
        </summary>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[15px] text-foreground leading-[1.6]" data-ps="src/components/home/FAQ.astro:v2sduk">
          Call us for a free consultation. Bring any documents you have about your accident or injury. We'll listen, ask questions, and tell you honestly what we think about your case.
        </p>
      </details>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Help CTA Box -->
    <div class="text-center mt-14 space-y-3" data-ps="src/components/home/FAQ.astro:ybu4z4">
      <h3 class="font-bold font-serif text-[rgb(2,6,4)] text-[22px]" data-ps="src/components/home/FAQ.astro:dig58y">
        Need more help?
      </h3>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground text-[16px] mb-6" data-ps="src/components/home/FAQ.astro:v2sdul">
        Reach out and we'll answer anything else you need to know.
      </p>
      <a
        href="/#free-consultation"
        class="bg-primary text-white border border-primary px-6 py-3 rounded-[4px] font-medium text-[16px] hover:bg-primary-hover transition-colors no-underline inline-block shadow-sm"
       data-ps="src/components/home/FAQ.astro:wudrfm">
        Schedule a Free Consultation
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
